% Free-fall collapse of a cold uniform sphere (cf. OpenGadget3 FreefallCollapse, Dolag+ 2026 sec 2.5)
% Code units G = M = R = 1: t_ff = pi/(2 sqrt(2)) = 1.1107.
%
% TimeMax = 1.0 = 0.900 t_ff: radius down 2.85x, density up 23x. Late enough that a force or
% integration error has compounded into the Lagrange radii; early enough that the fixed
% softening (support 0.07) is still ~1/5 of the sphere radius (0.35) and the centre has not
% collapsed below the resolution. OG3 runs to 0.95 t_ff (radius down 4.1x).
%
% SofteningGas = 0.025 = 0.5 x the lattice spacing d = 0.0504 (Plummer-equivalent; kernel
% support 2.8 x 0.025 = 0.07). The ADAPTIVE_GRAVSOFT_FORGAS variant overrides it to 1e-4 (see
% test_freefall.py): under AGS the tree still floors a gas target's softening at 2.8 x SofteningGas
% (gravity/forcetree.cc), which would freeze the AGS softening at 0.07 once the collapse shrinks
% the kernel radius (0.1 at t=0) below it.
%
% Cold gas: u0 = 1e-5 is set in the ICs (c_s0 = 3.3e-3). Adiabatic compression to r = 0.35
% raises c_s by 1/r, so the final sound-crossing time is r^2/c_s0 = 37 >> t_ff, and the edge
% pressure acceleration ~ c_s^2/(gamma h) stays ~2e-4 of gravity throughout.
%
InitCondFile                       freefall_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            1.0
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.05
TimeBetStatistics                  0.05
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.005
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-9
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.005
CourantFac                         0.1
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.05
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
PartAllocFactor                    5
MaxMemSize                         3000
BufferSize                         100
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
GravityConstantInternal            1
SofteningGas                       0.025
SofteningHalo                      0.025
Softening_Type2                    0.025
Softening_Type3                    0.025
Softening_Type4                    0.025
Softening_Type5                    0.025
